# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local tooling
# `.claude/*`, not `.claude/` — git cannot re-include anything beneath a
# directory it has excluded outright, so the contents are ignored instead and
# the design skills are negated back in. They are part of the project: they
# are what keeps the look of this site consistent across machines.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.vscode/
